  {
   "key": "0x02",
   "name": "stb_w",
   "aliases": [],
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "271-274"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "316"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "342"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "374"
    },
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
     "function": "upd1990a_device::is_serial_mode"
    },
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
     "function": "upd1990a_device::stb_w",
     "case": [
      "MODE_REGISTER_HOLD"
     ],
     "preamble": true
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "STB is the strobe input.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "316",
       "sha": "2db66aed53998ec6003c22f63af4ed3aeeae211be4df5a1d9cfc54fb0c60ebeb"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Each command is latched with STB.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "274",
       "sha": "c444006521fc49a8c085ff3959a9bcc8ee3b821b8defd4b03c31f3f7f0624a17"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "A function mode can also be selected through serial data input, with C0 = C1 = C2 = VDD.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "272-273",
       "sha": "1b6a023ebe2cb67dd1070c39bb67ec74f7260f4c4f3ff4db81ad4caa5215fe28"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The commands C3' C2' C1' C0' are made effective only when C2 C1 C0 = 1 1 1.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "374",
       "sha": "c34d5c14b2a4b4d64163027d4701843261c647633b5dd6c1371720819a30b66b"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "5",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The test mode is cancelled by C2 C1 C0 = 0 0 0 to 1 1 0.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "342",
       "sha": "f7562801a18430d94b2022ecb2aae65be498340f4647eefd39dee6ed6b421b43"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "6",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "With CS high, MAME latches a command when STB goes from low to high and stores the STB level at the end of the call.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
       "lines": "189-190",
       "sha": "455c251366e17c16feec77a8fd49f1dd6339557df9bc66b6c1d9ac8a6c27fc71"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
       "lines": "194-195",
       "sha": "ee75f3083e81e8ec86ca134255003bea7de20ab5bba7ad85a92cc24bd268b254"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
       "lines": "198-204",
       "sha": "511a1aae6b7db76d9af6b991616c499aa30addedd0213c64d5a724eb660ce69a"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
       "lines": "365",
       "sha": "bd44a5e98d85c0b8432d840c404817e9de63d51f00c910982864de5579b2286a"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "7",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "In MAME serial mode needs the uPD4990A type as well as C2 C1 C0 = 1 1 1, so the uPD1990A type cannot enter it.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
       "lines": "66",
       "sha": "822cc7f08dd4951f9f078e08b32facda89505014156d78b99c99730cf25cbc62"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "8",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "When serial mode is off, MAME reads C2 C1 C0 = 1 1 1 as its test command.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
       "lines": "198-204",
       "sha": "511a1aae6b7db76d9af6b991616c499aa30addedd0213c64d5a724eb660ce69a"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "9",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "differs",
     "text": "MAME leaves test mode only on Register Hold and on the TP and interval commands, not on Register Shift, Time Set or Time Read.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
       "lines": "210-217",
       "sha": "990fc6b5c8d49d8027feffc892723a4ab2f7f39412bb2dca947e1aa8177bda54"
      }
     ],
     "row": "5"
    }
   ],
