  {
   "key": "0x03",
   "name": "clk_w",
   "aliases": [],
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "314"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "453-454"
    },
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
     "function": "upd1990a_device::clk_w"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "289"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
     "lines": "447"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "CLK is the shift clock input of the 40-/52-bit shift register.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "314",
       "sha": "46fe6a88b056bc8872782cfb544836fe768e14b3593e3e85930b46919832fbe8"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "CLK is the shift clock input of the 40-bit shift register.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "314",
       "sha": "46fe6a88b056bc8872782cfb544836fe768e14b3593e3e85930b46919832fbe8"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "CLK is the shift clock input of the 52-bit shift register.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "314",
       "sha": "46fe6a88b056bc8872782cfb544836fe768e14b3593e3e85930b46919832fbe8"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "6",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "In serial command transfer mode the serial command register is not held by the Register Hold command.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "447",
       "sha": "b28fa40b0a8fc5754dd50d4c0880f57d059a0f690974255890105013876e4ddf"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "453",
       "sha": "e897ef474cd1916a433809d036c985c02bbd9663988a537a73281cc840bceea6"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "7",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Accordingly, the serial command can be executed irrespective of the mode if the CS pin is active.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "453-454",
       "sha": "5e8465362b53ae473b1d83fc766c8b2461c25a11d353579188fc63b3dabfcfa3"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "mame",
     "vs": "extra",
     "text": "With CS high, MAME acts on a rising edge of CLK, shifts the data registers when the command is Register Shift, and stores the CLK level.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
       "lines": "375-376",
       "sha": "455c251366e17c16feec77a8fd49f1dd6339557df9bc66b6c1d9ac8a6c27fc71"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
       "lines": "380-381",
       "sha": "c1ed92858108c963c73c6c7f57e0a9ad8741260e3d7f3287f95462ce36013131"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
       "lines": "393-404",
       "sha": "a2250ed8858ce99f38ddb142e0c31afa5d27059a09cba464ad726748448a8864"
      },
      {
       "ref": "mame:src/devices/machine/upd1990a.cpp",
       "lines": "412",
       "sha": "d823cd737a1fb5c7b8354294b8e65f2f0be7847a07ebcd50ed7b47b6790abfab"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "8",
     "on": "write",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The data of the 52-bit shift register appears on DATA OUT starting from the least significant bit of the second.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:uPD4990A.raw.txt",
       "lines": "289",
       "sha": "b9a308f5aee50e43781a8367de958636d7e7601848f6768f5c2d0364f8f60237"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
   "closed": [
